DESCRIPTION:Join us for stories\, songs\, rhymes and activities for childr
 en ages 5 and under with their parents or caregivers.\nFamily Time\nruns f
 rom 10:30 to 11 am. Children\, parents and caregivers are invited to\nStay
  and Play\n\, from 11 to 11:30 am.\nStay and Play\nprovides a welcoming sp
 ace for children to play and learn while caregivers connect with each othe
 r and library staff.\nDrop-in. No registration required.
