 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nThe Spongebob Movie: Search for Sp
 ongebob\nSpongeBob and his Bikini Bottom friends set sail in their biggest
 \, all-new\, can't miss cinematic event ever... The SpongeBob Movie: Searc
 h for SquarePants. Desperate to be a big guy\, SpongeBob sets out to prove
