BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Wonder Wrap-Up Party: Alice in Wonderland
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260828T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260828T170000
UID:6a344374c7d3cd5800614a53@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a whimsical Alice in Wonderland wrap-up party feat
 uring a movie screening\, a scavenger hunt\, cookie decorating\, and freeb
 ies! For kids ages 0-12. Drop-in. Limited supplies available\, first-come\
 , first-serve.\nThe schedule for the wrap party will be:\n2:00-3:30 PM: Al
 ice in Wonderland Movie Screening\n- Jump down the rabbit hole with us to 
 watch the animated Alice in Wonderland movie!\n3:30-4:30 PM: Cookie decora
 ting\n- Decorate Alice in Wonderland themed cookies! Please note that ther
 e are a limited number of spots for cookie decorating. Tickets will be giv
 en out when the doors open at 2PM on a first-come\, first-serve basis. Lar
 ge groups (5 or more people) are not eligible for cookie decorating due t
 o limited space. Cookie decorating is for all ages but recommended for kid
 s ages 6 and older.\nFood allergy notice: Please be aware that food will b
 e used in this program. Certain food ingredients may cause allergic reacti
 ons in some people.\n3:30-4:30 PM: Scavenger Hunt\n- Participate in a scav
 enger hunt to find characters from Alice in Wonderland around the library 
 to win a prize!
LOCATION:York Woods\, Theatre
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a344374c7d3cd5800614a53
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
