BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Movies - Minions The Rise of Gru
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260829T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260829T160000
UID:6a1f2da890cc4e3a790aede0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nMinions The Rise of Gru\nIn the he
 art of the 1970s\, amid a flurry of feathered hair and flared jeans\, Gru 
 (Oscar nominee Steve Carell) is growing up in the suburbs. A fanboy of a s
 upervillain supergroup known as the Vicious 6\, Gru hatches a plan to beco
 me evil enough to join them. Luckily\, he gets some mayhem-making backup f
 rom his loyal followers\, the Minions. Together\, Kevin\, Stuart\, Bob\, a
 nd Otto\, a new Minion sporting braces and a desperate need to please\, de
 ploy their skills as they and Gru build their first lair\, experiment with
  their first weapons and pull off their first missions.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1f2da890cc4e3a790aede0
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
