BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TD Summer Reading Club - Book Reporting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260831T235959
UID:6a3a1877c026ff22477c0360@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Udpated: June 20th - August 27th.\nAges 0 - 13.\nSummer Readin
 g Club is here\n!  Register your child for the club and receive a TDSRC bo
 ok reporting workbook\, stickers\, and more to get the most out of your su
 mmer reading. Kids will be able to\nreport 2 books per day\nduring the boo
 k reporting times and for\nevery 5 books reported they will receive an ent
 ry for a grand prize\n! Find fun activities in branch all summer long and 
 online at\ntdsummerreadingclub.ca\n. This years theme is SET SAIL! Explore
  the worlds waterways\, its creatures and the world of reading all summer 
 long.\nAttend a program and book report after! Please check branch hours b
 efore you visit!\nReporting Times (during branch hours):\n11:00 - 12:00pm\
 , 3:00 - 4:00pm and 6:00 - 7:00pm.\nFrench Reading Challenge:\nWanna earn 
 some special prizes? For every book you read in French you'll be entered t
 o win a special prize pack! Learn more about FRC in branch.\nIn-branch Ac
 tivities:\nScavenger Hunt - Can you find all the pieces of your TDSRC work
 book hidden in the children's area? Test your perception with our scavenge
 r hunt!\nColouring Sheets - Colour to you hearts content with TDSRC themed
  colouring sheets. Set sail with your imagination to create something amaz
 ing!\nCan you spot the signs of Summer? - Want a challenge? Use your skill
 s to locate signs of summer on our find-it display!
LOCATION:Bendale\, Main Floor - Information Desk and Children's Area
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3a1877c026ff22477c0360
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
