 aced\, comedy magic show for the entire family.\nSuitable for children 3 y
 ears old and up with their parent or caregiver. This program can hold up t
 o 60 guests including adults with their children.\nWhen signing up please 
 indicate the number of people in your party including both children and ad
 ults\n. Adults are expected to accompany children to this program.\nInform
 ation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collect
 ed by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections
