BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Creative Writing Workshop with Sarabeth Holden
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260912T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260912T150000
UID:6a7cb7364c610f0038949315@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Author Sarabeth Holden (Sea Snooze\; Benny the Bananasaurus Re
 x) will read her new children's book\,\nStrawberry Sundaes\n\, and lead a
  story writing workshop where the audience members will create a story f
 rom words they suggest.\n​This creative writing workshop is for childre
 n ages 3 - 8.\nRegistration begins one month before program date. Register
  in person or by phone at 416-396-8979.\nFor all registered Children's pro
 grams at Malvern\, there is a grace period of 10 minutes. After the first 
 10 minutes of a program\, spots will be given to waiting customers.\nInfor
 mation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collec
 ted by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, section
 s 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event a
 nd program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the
  library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\n
 answerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8
 .
LOCATION:Malvern\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7cb7364c610f0038949315
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
