BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga Storytime with Appleseed Yoga
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260827T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260827T150000
UID:69fa359bc6a1dc3d00d1a958@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Join us for an interactive\, movement-based program where w
 e read stories and make them come alive with our bodies! Appleseed Yoga fo
 r Kids will deliver inspiring stories that get the whole family moving. Cl
 ass begins and ends with song and breathwork and is filled with pages of c
 reativity and activity. Kids and families can sit quietly and listen\, do 
 partial poses or make up their own\, following our lead. It's ALL yoga! No
  experience\, mats\, or materials required.\nFree tickets will be distribu
 ted from the front desk 30 minutes prior. All children welcome
LOCATION:Runnymede
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fa359bc6a1dc3d00d1a958
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
